import VeiledFlock.Production.Sampling.SamplingScheduleAudit

/-!
# Serialized-domain audit for the production sampling schedule

Every active query generated by the concrete state machine is either a
Fiat--Shamir query whose first encoded byte is `0x01`, or a PoW query whose
first encoded byte is `0x12`.
-/

